{"key": "2026-09-01-0060", "ts": "2026-09-01T15:22:56+01:00", "author": "teo", "type": "message", "payload": {"text": "The kiln has been broken for eleven weeks and the form goes to a ghost. That is the most school thing I have ever been told."}}
