{"key": "2026-09-01-0092", "ts": "2026-09-01T17:52:58+01:00", "author": "noor", "type": "todo_event", "payload": {"todo_id": "todo_spare_key", "action": "added", "text": "get a spare cut for his flat and it lives at mine", "assignee": "teo"}}
{"key": "2026-09-01-0093", "ts": "2026-09-01T17:55:25+01:00", "author": "noor", "type": "message", "payload": {"text": "put the key on the list before we both forget it again. the ninth is eight days of you being one dropped ring away from sleeping in a car park"}}
{"key": "2026-09-01-0094", "ts": "2026-09-01T17:58:51+01:00", "author": "teo", "type": "message", "payload": {"text": "I will get it cut tomorrow when the place by the bridge is open, and get bread in the same journey, which is two things in one journey and is my limit."}}
{"key": "2026-09-01-0095", "ts": "2026-09-01T18:01:17+01:00", "author": "noor", "type": "todo_event", "payload": {"todo_id": "todo_bread", "action": "added", "text": "bread from the bridge on the way down", "assignee": "teo"}}
{"key": "2026-09-01-0096", "ts": "2026-09-01T18:04:44+01:00", "author": "noor", "type": "message", "payload": {"text": "two things in one journey. look at you"}}
