{"key": "2026-09-01-0102", "ts": "2026-09-01T19:06:21+01:00", "author": "teo", "type": "message", "payload": {"text": "I have watched forty minutes of a programme about a canal boat and thought of you every time they hit something."}}
{"key": "2026-09-01-0103", "ts": "2026-09-01T19:12:48+01:00", "author": "noor", "type": "message", "payload": {"text": "we are not getting a boat"}}
{"key": "2026-09-01-0104", "ts": "2026-09-01T19:15:14+01:00", "author": "teo", "type": "message", "payload": {"text": "I have said nothing about a boat."}}
{"key": "2026-09-01-0105", "ts": "2026-09-01T19:18:40+01:00", "author": "noor", "type": "message", "payload": {"text": "you say it every september. the light goes and you start on about a boat and by november its a caravan"}}
{"key": "2026-09-01-0106", "ts": "2026-09-01T19:22:07+01:00", "author": "teo", "type": "message", "payload": {"text": "The caravan was one time and there was a reason."}}
