{"key": "2026-09-01-0108", "ts": "2026-09-01T19:40:59+01:00", "author": "noor", "type": "message", "payload": {"text": "twenty done. the ones with two names in take twice as long, which is obvious, and which i did not think about once in july"}}
{"key": "2026-09-01-0109", "ts": "2026-09-01T19:52:26+01:00", "author": "teo", "type": "message", "payload": {"text": "You did not think about anything in july. That was the entire purpose of july."}}
