{"key": "2026-09-01-0122", "ts": "2026-09-01T21:20:08+01:00", "author": "noor", "type": "message", "payload": {"text": "ten weeks. i worked it out on the back of a register and then scribbled over it so nobody would find it"}}
{"key": "2026-09-01-9013", "ts": "2026-09-01T21:23:08+01:00", "author": "teo", "type": "read_marker", "payload": {"upto_key": "2026-09-01-0122"}, "gen": "finish"}
{"key": "2026-09-01-0123", "ts": "2026-09-01T21:26:34+01:00", "author": "teo", "type": "message", "payload": {"text": "Ten weeks, and one of them is a half term you will spend asleep with a red pen still in your hand."}}
{"key": "2026-09-01-9516", "ts": "2026-09-01T21:30:11+01:00", "author": "noor", "type": "state_passive", "payload": {"signal": "battery", "value": 39}, "gen": "finish"}
{"key": "2026-09-01-0124", "ts": "2026-09-01T21:32:01+01:00", "author": "noor", "type": "message", "payload": {"text": "dont walk me through the year. i can see the whole of it from here and its long and its mostly weather"}}
{"key": "2026-09-01-0125", "ts": "2026-09-01T21:38:27+01:00", "author": "teo", "type": "message", "payload": {"text": "It is long. It is also the one where you keep the ones you had last year all the way through."}}
{"key": "2026-09-01-0126", "ts": "2026-09-01T21:44:53+01:00", "author": "noor", "type": "message", "payload": {"text": "thats the only good part of it. i get to find out what they did with what i gave them"}}
