{"key": "2026-09-01-0130", "ts": "2026-09-01T22:22:39+01:00", "author": "noor", "type": "message", "payload": {"text": "ive put the next one in for the 25th so that i stop asking you every friday whether its a roster friday"}}
{"key": "2026-09-01-0131", "ts": "2026-09-01T22:26:05+01:00", "author": "teo", "type": "message", "payload": {"text": "You ask because half the time you like the answer."}}
{"key": "2026-09-01-0132", "ts": "2026-09-01T22:34:31+01:00", "author": "noor", "type": "message", "payload": {"text": "i dont want to do the whole year again. i want to skip to the part where i know all their names and the room smells right and im not frightened of my own register"}}
{"key": "2026-09-01-0133", "ts": "2026-09-01T22:36:58+01:00", "author": "noor", "type": "message_delete", "payload": {"target": "k:2026-09-01-0132"}}
{"key": "2026-09-01-0134", "ts": "2026-09-01T22:39:24+01:00", "author": "noor", "type": "message", "payload": {"text": "ignore that. first day brain"}}
{"key": "2026-09-01-0135", "ts": "2026-09-01T22:42:50+01:00", "author": "teo", "type": "message", "payload": {"text": "I read it."}}
{"key": "2026-09-01-0136", "ts": "2026-09-01T22:45:17+01:00", "author": "noor", "type": "message", "payload": {"text": "i know you read it. thats why i took it back"}}
{"key": "2026-09-01-0137", "ts": "2026-09-01T22:48:43+01:00", "author": "teo", "type": "message", "payload": {"text": "You are frightened of the register every september and by the second week you are complaining that they will not stop talking. Those are the same person and I am fond of her."}}
{"key": "2026-09-01-0138", "ts": "2026-09-01T22:52:09+01:00", "author": "noor", "type": "message", "payload": {"text": "dont be kind at me at ten to eleven. im holding the whole thing together with sticky labels"}}
